        {
          "pdf_page": 143,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book019/doc008/source-page-0143.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 144",
          "anchor_preview": "以上出脉三格，中出为上，左出次之，右出又次之，左右全偏则无足取。但山龙变态不常，固有前中出而后偏者，亦有前偏出而后中者，又有交互中偏者，又有似偏而实中者，必须详辨，庶得其情性之真。图具下。"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 147,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book019/doc008/source-page-0147.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 148",
          "anchor_preview": "闪龙入首者，龙脉栖侧躲闪结穴也。山势直去，而脉侧偷闪于侧以结穴。若泥于直步龙神，撞脉取穴，则误矣。吴景鸾云“只泥穿心直串去，不识真龙转身处。真龙闪巧转身多，岂惟直串为可据。俗师不识玄微诀，只向直穿寻正"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 151,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book019/doc008/source-page-0151.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next visual block on PDF page 152",
          "anchor_preview": "![](assets/book019/doc008/5e7cffc0c2057542de7f7200cd3f0cb56e78f8290b1c18bd84838647207a6a3c.jpg)"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 185,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book019/doc008/source-page-0185.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 186",
          "anchor_preview": "凡双钳者，两脚左右皆生双枝者也。或三或四以上皆同。但钳多必须交牙为美，否则元辰太长，真气不聚。凡双钳之格，有三体。有左右皆双到者，要弯曲有情，不成相聞。有左右一前一后到者，要交牙弓抱，不相尖射。有内两"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 187,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book019/doc008/source-page-0187.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 188",
          "anchor_preview": "图一：在京山县南二十里，土名欧家冲。其龙来远，不详述。入局起御屏土星，正脉中落，逶迤数节，到头复束气，起金星，开钳结穴。钳脚掬抱，弯曲有情。下吐余毡平坦，明堂田源之水特朝。前沙天马、贵人、旗鼓、排衙罗"
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 193,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book019/doc008/source-page-0193.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 194",
          "anchor_preview": "乳穴，其乳下又各有出金、出木、出水、出火、出土五格，具下："
        },
        {
          "pdf_page": 194,
          "asset_relative": "assets/book019/doc008/source-page-0194.jpg",
          "already_present": false,
          "placement": "before_anchor",
          "anchor_reason": "next unique text block on PDF page 195",
          "anchor_preview": "凡乳穴者，皆有此五等，及带曜八格。图繁，不及详具。后穴星皆仿此。乳穴名地诸图附下。"
        }
      ]
